+# Wire Serialisation Format
+
+This project has no current recorded decision on the wire serialisation format. A decision record for it (`config/decisions/revoke-wire-format.json`, last set to `cbor`) existed in the repository history but was removed from the tree in commit `d419b4c` ("move decision config out of the tree"), and no replacement record has been added since. Until a new decision is recorded, no wire serialisation format should be treated as settled project policy.
